<Panels>
  <config><![CDATA[{
  "game_id": 73,
  "created_at": "2026-05-05T21:25:59.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 1,
  "properties": {
    "panels": [
      {
        "key": "testlesson-css-intro-panels-c4baca56-67e2-4e65-849f-2cdc2c70e41c",
        "text": "HTML gives structure to your web page, but it's pretty plain! Think of **CSS** as the *magic spell* that makes your page look amazing. It's how we add colors, fonts, and layouts.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/0dbf1a4358c2e2702a69a302def06f28-testlesson-css-intro-panels-panel-1-7ddaec08-2ee3-4909-8f78-7a933c053d71.png",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "testlesson-css-intro-panels-aa1dbe32-d77c-4e18-892b-10efa219b3a0",
        "text": "To use CSS, we often link to a separate file, like a spellbook! We add a special `<link>` tag within the `<head>` section of our HTML to connect them.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/a5b618d38b3e8a8678de12b2f6b40571-testlesson-css-intro-panels-panel-2-54cbf1db-1dc7-44c8-91ed-79f52d97da28.png",
        "layout": "text-top-left"
      },
      {
        "key": "testlesson-css-intro-panels-5816e079-c14a-4dd7-847c-06b5e902674b",
        "text": "Let's try some basic spells! The `background-color` property changes the entire page's background, and `color` changes the text color. Make your rave page vibrant!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/6acdb986ee8731d5b40705578ba93453-testlesson-css-intro-panels-panel-3-47d57966-1cb1-4697-9bc1-bd05e68c9f4f.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "testlesson-css-intro-panels-4ad426ab-89c1-44e0-9022-1a91c4599a30",
        "text": "Want to change the font to something more exciting? The `font-family` property lets you pick from different typefaces, just like choosing different magical writing styles for your web page!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/39e731f771273bedca34ff01a2577138-testlesson-css-intro-panels-panel-4-d37bb46f-3f05-407d-93bc-1cde50f75fe9.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      }
    ],
    "generate_prompt": "Introduce the concept of CSS for styling web pages. Explain how to link an external CSS file using a <link> tag in the <head>. Cover basic CSS properties like background-color, color for text, and font-family."
  },
